cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it using these metadata."
title: "MUSE accretion pipeline"
abstract: >-
  A staged, reproducible pipeline for VLT/MUSE narrow-field-mode integral-field
  data: raw-cube reduction, spectral extraction of a faint companion next to a
  much brighter primary star with six independent extraction schemes, and
  hydrogen-line accretion analysis with empirically calibrated detection limits.
type: software
authors:
